              "then": "each specified message is re-enqueued for delivery on that subscription and removed from the dead-letter queue"
            },
            {
              "id": "ac-2",
              "given": "a redrive request includes a message id that is already redriven or no longer present in the dead-letter queue",
              "when": "the operator submits that request",
              "then": "the system skips that id without failing the rest of the request, and the response reports a per-id outcome (redriven, skipped, or not-found)"
            },
